  "body": "`all required jobs passed` currently depends on only a subset of CI, so a selected trampoline test or release-build failure can leave the required check green.\n\nInclude every non-advisory CI caller in its `needs` list, including `plan`, and have the planner reject missing callers or unconsumed plan outputs. Reusable-workflow and matrix results feed the same stable check. Benchmarks and automated review remain explicitly nonblocking, and conditional skips remain allowed.\n",
